{"id": 10879, "group": "campus-iit-ropar-placements", "sent_at": "2026-10-22T18:32:30.70065+00:00", "text": "mcqs were simple - 12 mcqs - sql, oops, system design basic questions\n\n3 coding questions\n\n1. given n slots, c choices for each slot, we need to find out number of assignments such that some choice is not repeated more than k times in a row.\nn 1e9\nc 1e9\nk 100\n\n2. given a starting and ending point in 3d, and a string of L,R,U,D,F,B basically movement in all 3 directions. we need to find the min time to get to destination from starting point or -1 if not possible. The movement specified by the string is periodic and each movement takes up 1 time unit. During each time unit, we can also move in any one of the 6 directions as well.\n\n3. we have been given n layers of boxes of same height, each layer's width is the same but number of boxes inside a layer and their widths differ\neg: [1,3,3,1], [4,2], [1,3,2] we are firing an arrow from the top to hit a target at the bottom, we need to fire it so that it passes through minimum number of boxes, if we fire an arrow between the gap of boxes, it passes right through.\nfor the eg above if we fire at index 4, our arrow can pass write through all the 3 layers.\nn 1e4", "author_tag": "IITM", "reply_to": {"id": 10661, "text": "is lg ads oa done ? what were the questions asked in the oa and pattern", "author_tag": "IITI"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
